honors.description:
THE PURPOSE OF THE TRIG-STAR PROGRAM:
To promote excellence in the mastery of mathematics in high school;
To honor high students who have demonstrated their superior skill among classmates at the local, state, and national levels;
To acquaint high school students with the use and practical applications of matematics in the surveying profession;
To build an awareness of surveying as a profession among the mathematically-skilled high school students, career guidance counselors and high school math teachers.
* There is one winner from each participating high school.

